ct} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365854} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e53691a8-56dc-5432-a438-5f46e1b58514" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{84(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365859} {:answer/id #uuid "196f0467-aa9a-5dc4-9f2d-a092284d7726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{252(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365860} {:answer/id #uuid "11832860-c59a-52bc-a109-2bf27d8e48a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{84(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365861} {:answer/id #uuid "27bba06c-d9a4-51c7-b91c-fbb24dcd41e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365862}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e53691a8-56dc-5432-a438-5f46e1b58514" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{84(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365859} :answer-field/id #uuid "ee6f0836-26e1-5dfb-bc98-d28b73bc1c01" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365858} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ef6f471-8351-5c50-a2e4-1b507d5c8afd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365864} {:answer/id #uuid "0d2923b5-c519-5424-b6bb-4cf87a97ea9f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365865}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4ef6f471-8351-5c50-a2e4-1b507d5c8afd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365864} :answer-field/id #uuid "a2ef6fba-db58-5439-a0bb-804487d34f31" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365863}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6d18e00a-46f0-53e8-8f7c-935fda52873e" :question/math-academy-id "q-343245" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $6$-periodic extension of the function $F(x)=-7{x}^{2}+4$ defined on $[-3,3).$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below, showing the derivation of the Fourier series of the $6$-periodic extension of $G(x)=-14x$ from the corresponding Fourier series of $f(x).$The Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\n-7{x}^{2}+4∼-17+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f$ is \n{{field-2}}\nand\n{{field-3}}\non $R,$ we may differentiate its Fourier series term-by-term to get\n\n$$\n-14x∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{{field-4}}\\cdot {{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $F(x)$ is an even function. So, the Fourier series of its $2L$-periodic extension has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=3$ and we are already given the coefficients ${a}_{0}$ and ${a}_{n}$ for $n\\ge 1.$ Thus, the Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼-17+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that \n\n- the function $F$ is continuously differentiable on $(-3,3),$\n\n- continuous on $[-3,3),$ and\n\n- satisfies $F(-3)=F(3),$ if we extend the value at $x=3$ using the formula $F(x)=-7{x}^{2}+4.$\n\nTherefore, the $6$-periodic extension $f$ is $\\text{continuous}$ and $\\text{piecewise smooth}$ on $R,$ so we may differentiate its Fourier series term-by-term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7{x}^{2}+4) & ∼\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-17)+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\ -14x & ∼0+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\cdot (-\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\ -14x & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{-84(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\ -14x & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{84(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi }\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186365866 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2e37d37-007c-569b-a44c-cb6a9d075371" :knowledge-point/title "Differentiating a Fourier Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "701acf4a-cb36-5287-b251-629fb97184d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365868} {:answer/id #uuid "04dc5c9f-aff0-52e6-b5cb-39e3ded5ec7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{6})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365869} {:answer/id #uuid "cc71cb98-c029-5878-bc01-80dfe69cab2d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365870} {:answer/id #uuid "9c57a2a0-1962-5892-a254-1371c876ca25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{6})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cc71cb98-c029-5878-bc01-80dfe69cab2d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365870} :answer-field/id #uuid "102ed9a9-0430-5250-b464-aa8b7154769a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365867} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e2060bd9-35d1-5494-b059-20a8ff01751b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "even" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186365873} {:answer/id #uuid "36d30613-e265-5bda-9acc-e5565d3504be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/v